<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten products prices flat, trade slow.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten products prices flat, trade slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal prices were unchanged Tuesday in slow trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some dealers reported improved domestic demand for corn gluten pellets, while meal business remained light.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
